{
  "237": [
    {
      "text": "10 月初，TorrentFreak\n报道了 Denuvo 向法院提出的申请：",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 3920,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "在正常取证阶段之前，",
      "startMs": 3920,
      "endMs": 5520,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "先向 Discord、Valve\n和 Reddit 发出传票。",
      "startMs": 5520,
      "endMs": 8253,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "238": [
    {
      "text": "按 Denuvo 的说法，它先直接找过这三家公司。",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 3203,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "239": [
    {
      "text": "Valve 和 Reddit 回复说，",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 1710,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "没有法律依据，隐私政策不允许它们交出用户资料。",
      "startMs": 1710,
      "endMs": 5397,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "240": [
    {
      "text": "Discord 干脆没回。",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 1310,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "241": [
    {
      "text": "它想要的东西很多。",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 1310,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "242": [
    {
      "text": "除了账号和 IP 地址，",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 1680,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "还有 Steam 上的付款和交易记录、登录日志，",
      "startMs": 1680,
      "endMs": 4820,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "以及 voices38 在\nReddit 上的全部帖子和评论。",
      "startMs": 4820,
      "endMs": 8299,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "243": [
    {
      "text": "10 月 8 日，",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 1000,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "法官 Haywood S.\nGilliam Jr. 发出命令。",
      "startMs": 1000,
      "endMs": 3644,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "244": [
    {
      "text": "命令先指出一个程序问题：",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 2100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "按规定，这类申请要附上一份拟议命令，",
      "startMs": 2100,
      "endMs": 4790,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Denuvo 没附。",
      "startMs": 4790,
      "endMs": 5583,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "245": [
    {
      "text": "法官要它补交，还提醒它，",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 2340,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "接下来的诉讼里要遵守法院的规定。",
      "startMs": 2340,
      "endMs": 4677,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "246": [
    {
      "text": "然后才是重点。",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 985,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "247": [
    {
      "text": "法官要求 Denuvo 解释：",
      "startMs": 20,
      "endMs": 2000,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "只是为了确认被告是谁、把起诉书送到他手上，",
      "startMs": 2000,
      "endMs": 5670,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "为什么需要这么多数据？",
      "startMs": 5670,
      "endMs": 6964,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "248": [
    {
      "text": "这些请求，远远超出了识别被告的需要，",
